\@writefile{lol}{\contentsline {lstlisting}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Staged training schedule (Stage A then Stage B). At the start of each stage all parameters are frozen and the trainable subset is re-enabled. Kronecker factors of all seven projections are optimised in both stages; the staging only toggles which per-channel diagonal (MLP vs attention) is trained, and Stage B drops the learning rate by 10x so the MLP basis is fine-tuned, not displaced.}}{53}{lstlisting.5}\protected@file@percent }
